<title>HUNGARY: Hungarian O/N rates end steady in routine trade.</title>
<headline>Hungarian O/N rates end steady in routine trade.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates finished little changed in routine trading on Wednesday as demand slightly exceeded supply, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates finished at 20.625/20.875 percent, compared to Tuesday's close of 20.625/20.75 percent and Wednesday's opening at 20.50/21.00 percent.</p>
<p>Dealers said they saw no major market moving factors with no tax payments due this week.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
